.code-graph/

# gstack project artifacts (security reports, plans, telemetry) — local-only, may
# leak attack-path summaries onto a public repo if accidentally git-add'd.
.gstack/

# Claude Code workspace state (sessions, permission grants, local hooks) — user-specific + transient.
.claude/

# docs/ is local-only by default. Tracked + shipped exceptions (functional
# reference docs that adopters / contributors need):
#  - docs/superpowers/ (design + implementation plan)
#  - docs/ADDING-NEW-HOOK.md (external contract: how to add a hook)
#  - docs/RULE-HITS-SCHEMA.md (external contract: JSONL schema)
#  - docs/cross-project-pilot.md (external contract: portability checklist for adopters)
#  - docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (three-layer design + hook taxonomy reference)
#  - docs/HOOK-PROTOCOL.md (hook stdin/stdout I/O contract)
# Historical / analysis scratch stays local: claude-spec-hooks-PLAN.md,
# spec-audit-*.md, and the *.txt review reports.
docs/*
!docs/superpowers/
!docs/ADDING-NEW-HOOK.md
!docs/RULE-HITS-SCHEMA.md
!docs/cross-project-pilot.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/HOOK-PROTOCOL.md

# tasks/ is a local-only working space by default (audit / analysis / planning
# scratch — not project function; npm tarball already excludes it via .npmignore).
# Tracked + shipped exceptions are ONLY the working docs that a distributed artifact
# cites as provenance (so the reference does not dangle) plus the §13.4 / §2.S
# convention files:
#  - tasks/specs/ (§2.S SPEC ARTIFACT — persistent design record per feature)
#  - tasks/s8-tokenizer/ (CHANGELOG equivalence-proof harness)
#  - tasks/lessons.md, tasks/rule-candidates-2026-04.md (§10-R / §13.2 + hard-rules.json)
#  - the audit-deferred / evaluation / provenance files cited by spec CLAUDE-extended.md,
#    hooks/scripts comments, or CHANGELOG.
# NEW working docs stay local unless added here. Rule: feedback_docs_tasks_local_only.
tasks/*
!tasks/specs/
!tasks/s8-tokenizer/
!tasks/lessons.md
!tasks/rule-candidates-2026-04.md
!tasks/audit-2026-07-15-deferred.md
!tasks/audit-2026-07-25-deferred.md
!tasks/banned-vocab-demote-evaluation-2026-07-25.md
!tasks/banned-vocab-sanitizer-siblings.md
!tasks/core-net-delete-candidates-v6.14.md
!tasks/design-adopt-review-findings-2026-07-05.md
!tasks/improvement-candidates-2026-05.md
!tasks/manifest-pluginroot-stale-cache.md
!tasks/memory-read-check-transcript-lag.md
!tasks/project-audit-findings-2026-07-03.md
!tasks/s8-false-negative-audit-2026-07-03.md
!tasks/s8-npx-message-fp-deferred.md
!tasks/s8-sanitize-brace-heredoc.md
!tasks/sampling-detector-labeling-2026-07-24.md
!tasks/spec-audit-2026-07-11.md
!tasks/statusline-host-wrap-deferred.md
!tasks/tmp-retention-followup.md
